---
// Phase 9 — the close. The mockup (mockups/dive-log.html, section.contact)
// ends on a large statement in deep water rather than a small footer
// heading; the statement, the paragraph, the pill-shaped contact row, the
// hairline and the two mono lines below it are all reused verbatim from it.
//
// ONE DELIBERATE DEPARTURE, flagged rather than silently taken. The brief
// (phase-7-9-brief.md, Phase 9) says the live site's contact links "are the
// same honest placeholders the live site already has" and must stay plain
// non-link elements reading [ADD EMAIL] / [ADD GITHUB] / [ADD LINKEDIN].
// That premise is not true of this codebase: the footer carries three real,
// working destinations (verified in dist/index.html at the time of writing).
// Replacing real contact details with placeholders would delete content,
// not preserve it, so the anchors stay anchors. Nothing here was invented:
// the three destinations are the ones that were already shipped, unchanged.
// If Wei Yan wants the mockup's placeholders instead, that is a content
// decision for him, not one to take by inference from a brief.
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 class="big">Enjoyed the dive?<br />Do reach out!</h2>
      <p class="copy">
        Looking for 2027 graduate roles, and always happy to talk to people building
        something awesome! Dive recommendations are also welcome :)
      </p>
      <ul class="links">
        <li><a href="mailto:weiyanminoo1@gmail.com">weiyanminoo1@gmail.com</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/weiyanminoo" rel="noopener">github.com/weiyanminoo</a></li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wei-yan-min-oo/" rel="noopener"
            >linkedin.com/in/wei-yan-min-oo</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="foot">
        <span>WEI YAN &middot; SINGAPORE</span>
        <span>MAX DEPTH 32 M &middot; NO DECOMPRESSION LIMIT NOT EXCEEDED</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  /* The footer is the mockup's closing section, so it carries a section's
     own rhythm (base.css's `section{padding-block:112px}`) rather than the
     88px margin it used before Phase 8 — it is a <footer>, so that rule
     does not reach it and the padding is set here instead. */
  /* Uncarded, this text sits straight on the water, so it cannot use the
     shared secondary tokens: on the light pages --ink-2 measured 3.54:1
     against mid-depth water. --ink is dark enough there but is NOT remapped
     by the deep zone (only --ink-2/--ink-3 are), so the footer carries its
     own pair and switches them itself. */
  .site-footer {
    --footer-2: var(--ink);
    --footer-3: var(--ink);
  }

  :global(html.depth-deep) .site-footer,
  :global(.zone-deep) .site-footer {
    --footer-2: var(--on-deep-2);
    --footer-3: var(--on-deep-3);
  }

  .container {
    padding-block: 112px;
  }

  /* No card here. The mockup's closing section sits directly on the water so
     the bubbles and fauna read through it; a tinted panel hid both. */
  .card {
    padding: 0;
  }

  /* Mockup's .contact h2.big. Large text at every viewport width (the clamp
     floor is 38px), so 3:1, not 4.5:1. */
  .big {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6.2vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  /* Mockup's .contact p. */
  .copy {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 44ch;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--footer-2);
  }

  /* Mockup's .links: a row of pills. The mockup's own are inert <span>s
     because it has no destinations to point at; ours are real links (see
     the frontmatter note), so they keep the 44px target and an underline
     on hover rather than relying on the pill shape alone. */
  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 34px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    color: inherit;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .links a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  /* Mockup's .foot: a hairline, then two mono lines pushed to the edges. */
  .foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 70px;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--footer-3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .container {
      padding-block: 72px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 0;
    }

    .links a {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
